<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>EchoEx - Início</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
    <style>
        body { display: block; background-color: white; }
        header { background-color: #3A5D2E; color: white; padding: 15px 40px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
        .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 20px; align-items: center; }
        .nav-links a { color: white; text-decoration: none; font-size: 18px; }
        .btn-register { background: #E0E0E0; color: #333; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 20px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; }
        .hero { display: flex; padding: 50px; gap: 40px; align-items: center; }
        .hero-img { width: 450px; height: 280px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 8px; }
        .banner-cards { display: flex; gap: 20px; margin-left: auto; }
        .banner-card { width: 140px; height: 350px; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; position: relative; }
        .banner-card img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; filter: brightness(0.6); }
        .banner-card span { position: absolute; top: 15px; left: 10px; color: white; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="logo-container" style="margin: 0;">
            <div class="logo-text">ECHO EX</div>
        </div>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="visao-geral.html">Fazer Login</a>
            <a href="#" class="btn-register">Crie agora sua conta &gt;</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="hero">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586528116311-ad8dd3c8310d?w=800" class="hero-img" alt="Centro Logístico">
        <div>
            <h1 style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: normal; max-width: 300px;">Bem vindo ao Centro Logístico Online da EchoEx! Onde a organização acontece.</h1>
            <p style="margin-top: 30px; font-size: 18px;">Acesse as guias para acessar as funções como <a href="receber-pacotes.html">Receber Pacotes</a> e ver os seus <a href="pacotes-armazenados.html">Pacotes Armazenados</a>.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="banner-cards">
            <div class="banner-card">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1526304640581-d334cdbbf45e?w=400" alt="">
                <span>Horários e Capacidade</span>
            </div>
            <div class="banner-card">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554224155-8d04cb21cd6c?w=400" alt="">
                <span>Remuneração</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
</body>
</html> 
